' `VictoryCondition` in v1.2 (`preset classic ai none seed 36 players A,B`): B
' dies; the next time A plays he is offered the last rival's victory, once,
' and declines; nothing offers it again. B falls in Nob Hill in his own turn
' — the radiation (ApplyContinuousHazard) or a mutant's bite at the end of his health (one bite a second in the game,
' `ClassicGame.TryBeginCreatureAttack`) — so his death is settled when his
' day ends and the offer comes at the start of A's next turn. The cut is
' while B still stands there among the mutants, so the resume carries how
' they move and bite (save version 23).
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
day                      ' A's first day
wait 30
mapclick 19,292          ' B walks into Nob Hill: radiation and mutants
wait 60
wait 300
mapmove -116,0           ' the pointer off the place: a load does not know where it was, and v1.2 stops whoever is under it (Character.cs:1007-1009)
save                     ' the cut, B alive among the mutants
wait 2700                ' B is killed where he stands
day                      ' his day ends: his death settled, its film, and A's turn with the offer
wait 30
clock 300000             ' the turn's time runs out while it asks: nothing happens
wait 30
talkline 1               ' "Finish what I started": declined, play on
wait 20
day
wait 30
day
wait 30
save
